  {
    "title": "SHEIN Distribution Corporation Recalls Baby Rattle and Teether Toy Sets Due to Risk of Serious Injury or Death from Choking; Violate Mandatory Small Parts Ban",
    "url": "https://www.cpsc.gov/Recalls/2027/SHEIN-Distribution-Corporation-Recalls-Baby-Rattle-and-Teether-Toy-Sets-Due-to-Risk-of-Serious-Injury-or-Death-from-Choking-Violate-Mandatory-Small-Parts-Ban",
