  {
    "title": "Kakgold Recalls 4WD Remote-Controlled Car Toys Due to Risk of Serious Injury or Death from Battery Ingestion; Violate Mandatory Standard for Toys",
    "url": "https://www.cpsc.gov/Recalls/2027/Kakgold-Recalls-4WD-Remote-Controlled-Car-Toys-Due-to-Risk-of-Serious-Injury-or-Death-from-Battery-Ingestion-Violate-Mandatory-Standard-for-Toys",
